#, fuzzy
msgid "Azure Functions (Serverless) with RESTEasy Reactive, Undertow, or Reactive Routes"
msgstr "使用 RESTEasy Reactive、Undertow 或 Reactive Routes 的 Azure 函数（无服务器"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The `quarkus-azure-functions-http` extension allows you to write microservices with RESTEasy Reactive (JAX-RS),\n"
"Undertow (servlet), Reactive Routes, or xref:funqy-http.adoc[Funqy HTTP] and make these microservices deployable to the Azure Functions runtime."
msgstr "通过 `quarkus-azure-functions-http` 扩展，您可以使用 RESTEasy Reactive (JAX-RS)、Undtow (servlet)、Reactive Routes 或 xref:funqy-http.adoc[Funqy HTTP] 编写微服务，并将这些微服务部署到 Azure Functions 运行时。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "One azure function deployment can represent any number of JAX-RS, servlet, Reactive Routes, or xref:funqy-http.adoc[Funqy HTTP] endpoints."
msgstr "一个 azure 功能部署可以代表任意数量的 JAX-RS、servlet、Reactive Routes 或 xref:funqy-http.adoc[Funqy HTTP] 端点。"

msgid "This technology is considered {extension-status}."
msgstr "这项技术被认为是{extension-status}。"

msgid ""
"In _preview_, backward compatibility and presence in the ecosystem is not guaranteed.\n"
"Specific improvements might require changing configuration or APIs, and plans to become _stable_ are under way.\n"
"Feedback is welcome on our https://groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[mailing list] or as issues in our https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub issue tracker]."
msgstr "在 _preview(预览)_ 中，不保证向后兼容和在生态系统中的存在。具体的改进可能需要改变配置或API，并且正在计划变得 _稳定_ 。欢迎在我们的 link:https://groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[邮件列表] 中提供反馈，或在我们的 link:https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub问题列表] 中提出问题。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "For a full list of possible statuses, check our https://quarkus.io/faq/#what-are-the-extension-statuses[FAQ entry]."
msgstr "如需查看所有可能状态的完整列表，请参阅我们的 link:https://quarkus.io/faq/#what-are-the-extension-statuses[常见问题解答] 。"

msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "先决条件"

